{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf96658c6791afa6d28acdcc31150d2b6d763ca337bbd401d47d70575d48cc74",
      "text": "（但是，就算沉迷进去，要是最后又……\n什么都没有得到的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e8ccc5c2f592443ae0d54406190413f1b8174cb4e203b923c81e7f3f550270",
      "text": "……花园，你没事吧？\n抱歉，我说了奇怪的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:186d10a24f150d70c8726379a88891568e6697ae2159fe1f6f313d85791e3864",
      "text": "啊……啊哈哈，对不起。\n我只是在想，我也和鹰城先生一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8154f3450c787399bda9a7454a2814aa7f759754aa1740fe4c33ac5e519e786f",
      "text": "我也是来到这里之后……得到了很多很多东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf41c9420ded54bfc2030ab58e59fdcf0413a7bd634e96fcf5335a110a1d833a",
      "text": "甚至多到让我觉得，\n可以试着再次按照自己的想法走走看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64a0321ec6cf7469872ae118f7f72b9f89c312adc568d092ffe342778c23ca58",
      "text": "（比如想试着去唱让自己心动的歌曲）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1c159d5a26c2d7b889201ee151bf02ae010821151713ad987544325971e6fcc",
      "text": "（比如想把难以言表的心情，\n传达给P酱之类……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9942ddaa2633fd4e9867496abd8c190e1e15261bbbadee9da4bee0d40bc141aa",
      "text": "但是……每当想要去做些什么的时候，我就会忍不住去想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93319e313726071716ec1bf3cd83101f6470c1079981ae838f660cb3d730a3c1",
      "text": "万一这会让谁失望、\n或者给别人添麻烦的话，该怎么办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ad5b8529c6b755d4becd94db3b66e27c63827fd4206d1d51b8079d30df46eca",
      "text": "如果会变成那样的话……\n是不是把自己的心情抹掉反而比较好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f129e590c4b82adb8aebb9378e9651bd702cee0f6dfda7a785f7dbe69a0e2e0",
      "text": "……我倒不这么认为呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
